<title>USA: Palomar's Nexar unit names Hattori CFO.</title>
<headline>Palomar's Nexar unit names Hattori CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nexar Technologies Inc, the personal computer subsidiary of Palomar Medical Technologies Inc, said on Monday that it has named Gerald Hattori to the newly created positions of vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Before joining Nexar, Hattori was controller for Sipex Corp and worked on Sipex's initial public offering in April, the company said.</p>
<p>Sara Buda, a spokeswoman for Nexar, said Nexar is preparing to introduce a personal computer that will build on the company's line of upgradable PCs. She said the company will release further details on the product when it is introduced in November.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
